# (0.23) Printer in the text shell, second session (tests/mousegen.py makes
# tests/printer2.keys from this): no PC volume, no /Printouts at start, no clock (every job
# is dated 2026-01-01 00.00.00); emu816 --classic-print tests/lprint.bin@6 and @12 (jobs
# finished at 9 and 15 s: "... Atari.txt", then "... Atari 2.txt"). Shots (s):
#   1   5.0  no jobs: how to print; Delete, Send to PC, Open in Edit dimmed
#   2  11.0  the first job arrived (the timer): selected, its preview (a long line wrapped)
#   3  16.5  the second one ("Atari 2", the same second) on top; the selection stays
#   4  20.0  the window made smaller with its grip: the text wrapped again
#   5  26.0  Esc closed it; "printer PATH" selects that job (not the newest)
#   6  29.0  Enter: the job opened in Edit
1500 {esc}
3000 printer\n
17000 M 100:100:0:0
17050 M 100:61:0:0
17100 M 75:0:0:0
17300 M 0:0:0:1
17400 M -30:-30:0:1
17460 M -30:-11:0:1
17520 M -30:0:0:1
17580 M -30:0:0:1
17640 M -5:0:0:1
18500 M 0:0:0:0
21000 {esc}
22000 printer "/Printouts/2026-01-01 00.00.00 Atari.txt"\n
26500 \n
